# uv.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. This is an application, not a
# library: the lock is the reproducibility guarantee, CI syncs from it,
# and setup-uv keys its cache on it. genai/ tracks its lock for the same
# reason. Ignoring it here was a template leftover.
